{"computedAt":"2026-11-13T14:15:32.337Z","windowHours":48,"entries":[{"rank":1,"story":{"publicId":"5b0f408b-d9c6-45eb-9a9f-74166b061b60","title":"天文学家首次发表白矮星-类太阳双星系统射电脉冲研究"},"heat":10.6,"trend":"down","trendPct":-16.4,"badges":[],"participantCount":2,"sourceCount":2,"sourceNames":["Phys.org","奇客 Solidot"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/0d041b355a9843928c182efcae3dde7fefee4b2e0224795801d24676153cf0a8.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/3d9f1092de237734c1d9b47f5f7f2e9fceaf7f66932ef9d5bb357a8c16037d89.webp 48w, /hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/0d041b355a9843928c182efcae3dde7fefee4b2e0224795801d24676153cf0a8.webp 96w","name":"Phys.org","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/77c233158f61553b453a41a55928d5b940f130bdea86733b1c752d8dbb5a7edc.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/985e5904e488a8ecc8ea512b301064cad09ee3a3e2ca70b75fc6b8242fe53875.webp 48w, /hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/77c233158f61553b453a41a55928d5b940f130bdea86733b1c752d8dbb5a7edc.webp 96w","name":"奇客 Solidot","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,null,9.4,9.1,null,18.4,17.9,null,16.9,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"summary":"研究团队在《Nature Astronomy》发表论文，首次确认绕类太阳恒星运行的白矮星每8分钟发射射电信号，并通过MWA和MeerKAT望远镜发现白矮星运动与伴星磁暴活动存在关联。该成果为SKA望远镜后续研究提供数据基础。\n\n此前该双星系统被归类为长周期瞬变天体，此前此类系统中未观测到射电脉冲现象。早期报道称该发现可能揭示白矮星表面存在金属或高密度电子云，但具体机制尚未明确，且相关成果尚未正式发表。\n\n最新论文显示，研究团队通过多台射电望远镜的联合观测，确认信号周期稳定且与白矮星轨道运动存在相关性，论文已进入正式发表流程。","latest":"某研究团队在 Nature Astronomy 发表白矮星-类太阳双星系统每8分钟发射无线电信号的研究","cover":null},{"rank":2,"story":{"publicId":"900e38c4-2c67-4c7f-a84b-7bfeb4af433f","title":"CSIRO用机器学习算法独立验证M87*黑洞阴影及质量"},"heat":7.6,"trend":"down","trendPct":-15.4,"badges":[],"participantCount":2,"sourceCount":2,"sourceNames":["奇客 Solidot","Phys.org"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/77c233158f61553b453a41a55928d5b940f130bdea86733b1c752d8dbb5a7edc.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/985e5904e488a8ecc8ea512b301064cad09ee3a3e2ca70b75fc6b8242fe53875.webp 48w, /hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/77c233158f61553b453a41a55928d5b940f130bdea86733b1c752d8dbb5a7edc.webp 96w","name":"奇客 Solidot","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/0d041b355a9843928c182efcae3dde7fefee4b2e0224795801d24676153cf0a8.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/3d9f1092de237734c1d9b47f5f7f2e9fceaf7f66932ef9d5bb357a8c16037d89.webp 48w, /hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/0d041b355a9843928c182efcae3dde7fefee4b2e0224795801d24676153cf0a8.webp 96w","name":"Phys.org","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[18.6,null,17.6,17.1,null,16.1,15.6,null,14.8,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"summary":"CSIRO通过改进的机器学习算法（基于三重望远镜数据集）独立验证了M87*黑洞的环状阴影及质量，其结果与事件视界望远镜（EHT）2019年发布的图像在形态和尺寸上高度一致。\n该算法创新性地采用闭合三站配对而非传统两两配对方式，通过综合多望远镜测量结果计算校准误差，最终生成符合原始图像标准的重建图像。\n目前仅有CSIRO和EHT团队通过不同方法得出一致结论，尚未有其他机构复现验证。该成果可能扩展至地震监测和医学成像领域，但相关应用尚未实际落地。","latest":"某研究团队验证M87星系黑洞‘甜甜圈’图像无误","cover":null},{"rank":3,"story":{"publicId":"ab9cc2e7-bfce-4b1a-8c83-a926c8aa1a37","title":"BRAIN Initiative发布首个跨物种基底节细胞图谱及全脑扩展计划"},"heat":6.6,"trend":"down","trendPct":-16.5,"badges":[],"participantCount":2,"sourceCount":2,"sourceNames":["Cell","Nature"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/10e9894789c239cf80ae91e9309b86733b3184b34dc245d1434d4eb8ab8ebd56.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/274bcdc98d04a2b209beed660f59fbbf4cac33b3ef34c691ccadb9559d46572e.webp 48w, /hot-pages/acadhot/data/media/10e9894789c239cf80ae91e9309b86733b3184b34dc245d1434d4eb8ab8ebd56.webp 96w","name":"Nature","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":null,"name":"Cell","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,null,null,6.1,null,11.6,11.2,null,10.6,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"summary":"BRAIN Initiative Cell Atlas Network (BICAN) 发布首个整合人类、猕猴和狨猴基底节细胞的跨物种图谱，覆盖约200种细胞亚型，空间定位精度达微米级，解决了长期存在的跨物种比较技术瓶颈【新】报道13374。该图谱已应用于基底节相关神经疾病机制研究，但全脑扩展需在2027年启动，当前面临不同物种脑区结构差异带来的数据整合难题【新】报道13373。最新Nature报道显示，该图谱包含25.5万个细胞样本，发现部分细胞类型随年龄变化可能与神经退行性疾病相关【新】报道13383。研究成果分刊于Cell及其子刊，形成联邦参考模型支持跨物种比较【新】报道13374。","latest":"BRAIN Initiative Cell Atlas Network 构建人类和哺乳动物基底节细胞图谱","cover":null}]}